        "original_id": "5de16bd0-2006-5ee9-b6c2-666582e429fd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Simon Stephens, Sarah Frankcom\n- Places: Royal Exchange, Manchester, England, Lyric Hammersmith\n- Organizations: Royal Exchange Theatre, Royal Exchange Shopping Centre\n- Works: Punk Rock\n\nFacts:\n- The play Punk Rock was written by British playwright Simon Stephens.\n- Punk Rock premiered at the Royal Exchange in 2009.\n- Punk Rock later transferred to the Lyric Hammersmith and was directed by Sarah Frankcom.\n- The Royal Exchange is a Grade II listed building in Manchester, England.\n- The Royal Exchange complex includes the Royal Exchange Theatre and the Royal Exchange Shopping Centre.",
